  Description: "COMPANION / UNCOMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nLantern Guild companions
    gain 8% reach while at least one Spindle Wren talent is owned, subject to final
    range caps. Presence effect; extra copies do not multiply it.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE
    OWNED\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE
    IN THE WAITING REALM\nA guide carrying thread between settlements. They tied
    it to their wrist until every departure pulled them apart. They now teach travellers
    to hold and release their own ends, and seek a route that survives an honest
    goodbye.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed
    talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not
    multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale
    separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: archive, lantern-guild. Immortal. Weapon rolls
    on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids
    it."
